#: WAKE
msgid "WAKE"
msgstr "Au réveil"

#: WAKE@definition
msgid "**Description:** Upon waking up from a regular period of sleep, in order to start regular activities (this would exclude waking up from a nap or temporarily waking up during a period of sleep)

**Usage Notes:** e.g.

Take pulse rate on waking in management of thyrotoxicosis.

Take BP on waking in management of hypertension

Take basal body temperature on waking in establishing date of ovulation"
